From 69e020d3b5a4be33f9f8f23a417b7466b547fa84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:18:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: light the grids beside the west edge of the lantern
 radius

The Borg works out which grids its light reaches. The east block adds
the three grids two columns east of it (the row of the Borg and the rows
above and below). The west block added the row of the Borg and then the
two grids two rows above and below, which the north and south blocks add
already, instead of the rows above and below. So the grids one row up and
down and two columns west were never marked as lit, and a monster that
had stood there was treated as not having been in the light. Add the
grids one row above and below.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#40.

(cherry picked from commit 6dd5874b444b00b8185fce58c823002ab6c544ad)
---
 src/borg/borg-cave-light.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-cave-light.c b/src/borg/borg-cave-light.c
index d8b520aa0..03f933430 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-cave-light.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-cave-light.c
@@ -135,8 +135,8 @@ void borg_update_light(void)
         /* West of the player */
         if (borg_cave_floor_bold(borg.c.y, borg.c.x - 2)) {
             borg_cave_light_hack(borg.c.y, borg.c.x - 2);
-            borg_cave_light_hack(borg.c.y + 2, borg.c.x - 2);
-            borg_cave_light_hack(borg.c.y - 2, borg.c.x - 2);
+            borg_cave_light_hack(borg.c.y + 1, borg.c.x - 2);
+            borg_cave_light_hack(borg.c.y - 1, borg.c.x - 2);
         }
     }
 
